          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(grpc_server_duration_seconds_count{service=~\"$service\",code=~\"Unavailable|Internal|Unknown|DeadlineExceeded|DataLoss|ResourceExhausted\"}[5m])) / sum by (service) (rate(grpc_server_duration_seconds_count{service=~\"$service\"}[5m]))",
